# bat.tscn's reactions, as a rules sheet (CbRules: docs/looks.md, Rules sheets). Plain paths are
# from the scene's root.

# GlowWhileHot
while melee.hot
	set Model/Barrel surface_material_override/0:emission_energy_multiplier 4.0

# FlamesOnSwing
# SparksOnSwing: The sparks of a swing, started again at every swing. (A one-shot particle node that an animation only switches on does not start again while its last burst is still out: swings in a row had no sparks.)
on melee.swing
	subject ^^
	play AnimationPlayer slash
	delay 0.14
	call Model/Sparks restart

# SparksOnHit
on melee.hit
	subject ^^
	call Model/Sparks restart

# PredictSwing: the server swings again only once the last swing is over, at the clip's melee.done
# marker (1.1 s: animation_packs/source/Sword_Attack.res); a guess more often than that is a swing
# the server refuses. Move the marker, change this.
predict use as melee.swing
    cooldown 1.1
    stance melee_swing on full
